Conclusion:
The monolithic TIDE + H-MPPI SoC maps with exceptional resource headroom on the
xc7a200t platform (<18% LUTs, <4% FFs, <12% DSPs), enabling full concurrent
execution of the EKF OOSM coprocessor and 4-lane stochastic guidance accelerator.
